mapping "Y005.1" source="Y005" target="219236005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Y005 SNOMED CT 219236005 = a Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension that subdivides Y00
        (Athena ICD10 concept 45756468) by Swedish place/activity axes with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 4071457 = (sctid 219236005), the verified Athena crosswalk target for
        Y00 (ICD10 relationship 45756468 -> 4071457). Why this target: it is the authoritative standard
        concept the parent Y00 maps to, and the SE subdivision is fully contained by it.
        mapping_type=broader (target subsumes the source). Confidence (high): verified crosswalk with a
        small, well-understood breadth mismatch. Athena-local research only.
        """
}
